{"strongs": "H1141", "word": "בְּנָיָ֫הוּ", "translit": "be.na.yah", "root": "בני", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Yah hath built up", "definition": "בְּנָיָ֫הוּ , בְּנָיָה proper name, masculine ( Yah hath built up , compare יבנאל , Sabean בנאל DHM ZMG 1883, 15 ) — 1. one of David's captains and heroes, son of Jehoiada, בניהו 2Sam 8:18 ; 2Sam 23:20 ; 2Sam 23:22 ; 1Kgs 1:8 ; 1Kgs 1:10 ; 1Kgs 1:26 ; 1Kgs 1:32 ; 1Kgs 1:36 ; 1Kgs 1:38 ; 1Kgs 1:44 ; 1Kgs 2:25 ; 1Kgs 2:29 ; 1Kgs 2:30 (twice in verse); 1Kgs 2:34 ; 1Kgs 2:35 ; 1Kgs 2:46 ; 1Kgs 4:4 ; 1Chr 11:24 ; 1Chr 18:17 ; 1Chr 27:5 ; 1Chr 27:6 compare v 1Chr 27:34 (see Be ); = בניה 2Sam 20:23 ; 1Chr 11:22 . 2. one of David's thirty, בניהו 2Sam 23:30 = בניה 1Chr 11:31 ; 1Chr 27:14 . 3. a Simeonite, בניה 1Chr 4:36 . 4. Levites, \\ \\ a. בניהו 1Chr 15:18 ; 1Chr 15:20 ; 1Chr 15:24 \\ \\ b. ( id. ) 2Chr 31:13 \\ \\ c. בניה 2Chr 20:14 . 5. Israelites, בניה \\ \\ a. Ezra 10:25 \\ \\ b. v Ezra 10:30 \\ \\ c. v Ezra 10:35 \\ \\ d. v Ezra 10:43 \\ \\ e. Ezek 11:13 = בניהו v Ezek 11:1 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1189')\">BDB1189</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1141')\">H1141</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1188')\">BDB1188</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1190')\">BDB1190</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בְּנָיָ֫הוּ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>בְּנָיָה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>Yah hath built up</highlight>, compare <bdbheb>יבנאל</bdbheb>, Sabean <bdbheb>בנאל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>ZMG 1883, 15</sup></lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> one of David's captains and heroes, son of Jehoiada, <bdbheb>בניהו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:18\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,18)\">2Sam 8:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:20\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,20)\">2Sam 23:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 23: